{"body": "<html lang=\"ja\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no\">\n<style>\n    html{\n        text-size-adjust:100%;\n        -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;\n    }\n    body{\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        color: #fff;\n        padding: 10px;\n        max-width: 1400px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        overflow-wrap: break-word;\n        word-wrap: break-word;\n        text-size-adjust:100%;\n        -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;\n    }\n    /*ipad だけフォントサイズを上書き変更する*/\n    @media screen and (min-width: 768px) {\n        body {\n                font-size: 18px !important;\n        }\n    }\n    hr{\n        border: none;\n        border-top: 1px solid #a6b2be;\n        margin: 20px 0;\n        padding: 0;\n    }\n    img{\n        display: block;\n        max-width: 100%;\n        margin: 10px auto;\n    }\n    figcaption{\n        margin: 10px 0;\n    }\n    .news-title{\n        font-weight: bold;\n        color: #fff;\n        text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4), -1px 1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4), -1px -1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4), 1px -1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4);\n        background: linear-gradient(270deg, rgba(198, 255, 234, 0) 0%, rgba(114, 181, 255, 0.4) 100%);\n        padding: 4px 8px;\n        margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\n    }\n    .news-subtitle{\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 0 4px;\n        align-items: center;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        color: #6ed1ee;\n        margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\n    }\n    .news-subtitle img{\n        max-width: auto;\n        width: 14px;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n    }\n    /* 标题1 = 客户端 .news-title：蓝色渐变标题条（区块大标题，如「✦ 開催期間」） */\n    h1, .news-title{\n        font-size: 1.1em;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        color: #fff;\n        text-shadow: 1px 1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4), -1px 1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4), -1px -1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4), 1px -1px 0 rgba(11, 11, 87, .4);\n        background: linear-gradient(270deg, rgba(198, 255, 234, 0) 0%, rgba(114, 181, 255, 0.4) 100%);\n        padding: 4px 8px;\n        margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\n    }\n    /* 标题2 = 客户端 .news-subtitle：青色小标题 */\n    h2{\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 0 4px;\n        align-items: center;\n        font-size: 1em;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        color: #6ed1ee;\n        margin: 5px 0 10px 0;\n    }\n    p{\n        margin: 10px 0;\n    }\n\n   /* 上下スクロール（y軸）のみ許可 */\n   body {\n      touch-action: pan-y;\n   }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">항상</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">「뱅드림</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">! </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">아워 노트」를 </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">응원해 주시는 모든 분들께 감사드립니다.</span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\"><br/></span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">최근</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\"> Apple</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">에서 공개 및 출시한 최신 </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">OS </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">버전 「</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">iOS 27</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">」과 최신 기기 「</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">iPhone 18 </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">시리즈」</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">그리고 </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">10</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">월 출시 예정인 「</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">iPhone Duo</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">」에 대해 안내해 드립니다.&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">「뱅드림</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">! </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">아워 노트」는 현재 아래 </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">OS </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">버전 및 기기에서의 실행 상태를 확인 중입니다</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">.&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">이에</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">따라</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">해당</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\"> OS </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">버전 및 기기에서는 게임이 정상적으로 실행되지 않을 수 있습니다.</span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\"><br/></span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">iOS </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">기기를 이용하시는 경우</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">, </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">해당 </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">OS </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">버전에 대응하는 게임 업데이트가 배포될 때까지 해당 </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">OS </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">버전으로의 업데이트 및 대상 기기로의 변경을 보류해 주시기 바랍니다바랍니다</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">.</span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\"><br/></span></strong></p><h1 style=\"line-height: 1.7;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">【대상 OS 버전】</span></strong></h1><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">・</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">iOS 27</span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">・</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">iPadOS 27</span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\"><br/></span></strong></p><h1 style=\"line-height: 1.7;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">【대상 기기】</span></strong></h1><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">・</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">iPhone 18 </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">시리즈</span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">・</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">iPhone Duo</span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\"><br/></span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">여러분이</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">원활하게</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">게임을</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">즐기실</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">수</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">있도록</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">최적화 및 </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">대응 작업을</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">진행하고</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">있습니다</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">. 실행 여부 확인 및 대응 작업이 완료되기 전까지 해당 운영체제 버전 및 기기는 고객센터 지원 및 정상적인 게임 이용이 보장되지 않습니다.&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">실행</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">여부 확인</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">및</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">대응 작업이</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">완료되는</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">대로 별도의 공지를 통해 안내해 드리겠습니다.</span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\"><br/></span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">※해당 운영체제 버전 및 기기와 관련된 문의에 대해서는 원활한 안내 및 지원이 어려울 수 있습니다.</span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">※OS </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">업데이트 및 기기 </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">변경 여부는 이용자 여러분께서 신중하게 판단하여 결정해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\"><br/></span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">이용에</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">불편을</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">드려</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">죄송하며</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">, 너른 양해</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\"> 부탁드립니다</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">.</span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\"><br/></span></strong></p><p class=\"paragraph text-align-type-left\" style=\";font-family: 等线;font-size: 16px;line-height: 24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">앞으로도</span> <span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">「뱅드림</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">! </span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-family: &#39;Microsoft YaHei&#39;;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">아워 노트」에 많은 관심과 성원 부탁드립니다</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0;vertical-align: baseline\">.</span></strong></p><p><br/></p>\n</body>\n</html>", "category": "OTHER", "endAt": "1798725120", "id": "100010", "lastUpdatedAt": "1790237312", "startAt": "1790085600", "title": "【중요】iOS 27 및 최신 iPhone 기기에서의 실행 관련 안내"}